// From the Threads screen, with another chat selected, open a thread in
// the long chat as its card does (at its first new reply, if any). The
// chat opens at its newest, nothing blank; then the thread closes.
// check: threads land=end
{"width": 1180}
{"select": "{{other}}"}
{"wait": 1.5}
{"open": "threads"}
{"wait": 1.5}
{"probe": "threads", "for": 5}
{"thread": "from-threads"}
{"wait": 2}
{"close": "thread"}
{"wait": 2}
